### Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| `os.ReadFile` | Simple one-call file read; available since Go 1.16 |
| `%w` in `fmt.Errorf` | Wraps errors so callers can use `errors.Is` / `errors.As` |
| Returns `*Config, error` | Idiomatic Go; nil pointer signals failure clearly |
| Field validation | Catches logical errors (empty name, bad port) beyond JSON parsing |
| `json:"..."` struct tags | Explicitly maps JSON keys to struct fields, avoiding case-sensitivity surprises |

