### Key Concepts

| Concept | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Worker Goroutines** | Fixed pool of `n` goroutines reading from shared channel |
| **Job Channel** | Distributes work; closing it signals workers to stop |
| **WaitGroup** | Tracks when all workers complete |
