### Design Principles

```
Jobs Channel → [Worker 1]  ↘
              [Worker 2]  → Results Channel → Consumer
              [Worker N]  ↗
```

- **Close jobs channel** to signal workers there's no more work
- **Use WaitGroup** to know when all workers are done
- **Buffer channels** appropriately to prevent deadlocks
- **Always close results channel** after workers finish so consumers can range over it

